    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Redacted \u2013 MVP\u00a0(Minimum Viable Product) Release</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the near future, a mysterious and advanced district, codenamed &quot;Genesis,&quot; becomes the epicenter of a covert genetic experiment gone catastrophically wrong.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This <strong>MVP </strong> version of <strong>Redacted Genome</strong>\u2014simply titled <strong>Redacted</strong>\u2014serves as the <strong>first step in delivering the full vision of the game</strong> and the <strong>launch point for the larger <i>Franchise Redacted</i>.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of <strong>Levi</strong>, a skilled special operations soldier sent into Genesis after the elite H.O.P.E. (Hostile Opposition Prevention and Elimination) team goes silent. What he finds is a once-thriving city consumed by grotesque mutations and overrun with horrors born from corrupted genetic experimentation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Levi navigates the desolate, decaying streets, players will uncover early pieces of the mystery surrounding the <strong>redacted genome project</strong>, engage in <strong>intense third- or first-person combat</strong>, and face evolving threats that require both strategic thinking and raw firepower.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This MVP version features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>vertical slice</strong> of the core gameplay mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense and atmospheric exploration</strong> within key sectors of Genesis</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Introductory narrative elements</strong>, including audio logs and documents from the fallen H.O.P.E. team</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A haunting soundtrack and striking visual contrasts between the utopia Genesis was and the nightmare it has become</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By supporting <strong>Redacted</strong>, you\u2019re not just playing a game\u2014you\u2019re helping build the foundation for the <strong>complete Redacted Genome experience</strong> and the future of the <strong>Franchise Redacted</strong>. Your feedback, support, and early engagement will directly influence the scope, direction, and development of what's to come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genesis has fallen. The truth begins here.</strong></p>",
